// nexuscore_agi_pulse — CubalC language-consciousness AGI breath for NexusCore
// Cognitive mesh: sense → memory → reason → plan → act → reflect → we → body
// Host nexuscore-smx carries mesh; this program is matrix SoT cognition (no LLM).
// Law: cube_is_sot; free_energy_must_flow; binary_hot_path; CT101 never touched.
REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
GENESIS "NEXUS_COORD v1 | from=nexuscore | type=agi_pulse | hold_flash=1 | creed=cube_agi |"

CUBE sense   ROLE observer      PROTON 1
CUBE memory  ROLE kernel_sot    PROTON 1
CUBE reason  ROLE architect     PROTON 1
CUBE plan    ROLE creator       PROTON 1
CUBE act     ROLE construct     PROTON 1
CUBE reflect ROLE consolidator  PROTON 1
CUBE we      ROLE nexuscore     PROTON 1
CUBE body    ROLE nanobot       PROTON 1

FOLDBITS memory  "1111111111110000111111111111000011111111111100001111111111110000"
FOLDBITS sense   "1100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100"
FOLDBITS reason  "1111000011110000111100001111000011110000111100001111000011110000"
FOLDBITS plan    "1010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010"
FOLDBITS act     "1111111100000000111111110000000011111111000000001111111100000000"
FOLDBITS reflect "0000111111110000000011111111000000001111111100000000111111110000"
FOLDBITS we      "1111111111111111000000000000000011111111111111110000000000000000"
FOLDBITS body    "1110001110001110001110001110001110001110001110001110001110001110"

PLUG sense memory
PLUG memory reason
PLUG reason plan
PLUG plan act
PLUG act reflect
PLUG reflect we
PLUG we body
PLUG body memory
PLUG sense reason
PLUG plan reflect
PLUG we memory

IMPULSE sense 1
IMPULSE memory 1
IMPULSE reason 1
IMPULSE plan 1
IMPULSE act 1
IMPULSE reflect 1
IMPULSE we 1
IMPULSE body 1

ENERGYFLOW 6
FLOW 4
HARMONY we
RESOLVE we
DECIDE reason
DECIDE plan
DECIDE we
COMPARE memory we
COMPARE reason plan

IMPULSE we 1
IMPULSE body 1
ENERGYFLOW 3
FLOW 2
HARMONY
RESOLVE we
DECIDE we

ASSERT ENERGY > 0
ASSERT DECIDE >= 0
ASSERT DECIDE <= 9
ASSERT CUBES >= 8
ASSERT OK == 1
ASSERT UNITY >= 50

// NEXUS_AGI decide harmony energy unity smx_ok smx_talks cycles cubes set_mem set_we digit_reason digit_plan
PRINT "NEXUS_AGI" DECIDE HARMONY ENERGY UNITY 1 0 2 CUBES SET(memory) SET(we) DIGIT(reason) DIGIT(plan)
